2026-10-31T00:00:25Z (RFD66606-2360) 'The platform
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:26Z (RFD66606-2360) 'The platform is one guest host, one message shape and one build path.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:27Z (RFD66606-2360) 'A use case is in the beta when it is a guest of that platform with a
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:28Z (RFD66606-2360) 'gate and a control, and it adds no host, message shape or build path
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:29Z (RFD66606-2360) 'of its own. The use cases maximize what the platform serves and the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:30Z (RFD66606-2360) 'work minimizes what each costs (operator, 2026-11-25). The use cases
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:31Z (RFD66606-2360) 'named are seeing each other (RFD66606-2436), voice between the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:32Z (RFD66606-2360) 'players, the console that loads, unloads and chains local models, and
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:33Z (RFD66606-2360) 'the persona that answers from a planning domain (RFD66606-2339), with
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:34Z (RFD66606-2360) 'the planner and the solver as its guests (operator, 2026-11-25). The
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:35Z (RFD66606-2360) 'beta ships each use case whose own gate has passed with its control by
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:36Z (RFD66606-2360) 'the cut; a use case whose gate has not passed does not hold the cut. A
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:37Z (RFD66606-2360) 'use case is a guest of the platform with a gate and a control, and
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:38Z (RFD66606-2360) 'adds none of its own. An RFD outside this list keeps its state
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:39Z (RFD66606-2360) '(RFD66606-1000).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

