 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:47Z (RFD66606-2360) 'Anything that is a protocol or a server has an AsyncAPI 3.1 document,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:48Z (RFD66606-2360) 'written before or with it (operator, 2026-11-25). A server is a
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:49Z (RFD66606-2360) 'gen_server. Its document may carry its states as data in
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:50Z (RFD66606-2360) '`x-state-machine`: an initial state, the states, and transitions that
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:51Z (RFD66606-2360) 'name messages of the document. The server refuses a message with no
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:52Z (RFD66606-2360) 'transition from its state, and a document without the block describes
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:53Z (RFD66606-2360) 'a plain gen_server (operator, 2026-11-25).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2360  1 LINE
 Text:Written

